<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University! As requested, <b>you and 0 guest(s)</b> are registered to attend <b>Scholar Day</b> at ASU's Polytechnic campus on <b>Thursday, Nov. 12 at 10:30 a.m.</b> We look forward to welcoming you to our beautiful campus.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The day is structured to provide you with a comprehensive overview of ASU. You will have many opportunities to ask all your questions and have personal conversations with ASU staff and students regarding all aspects of becoming a Sun Devil.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="text-align: center; "><font face="arial" size="5" color="#990000"><b>Scholar Day</b></font></div><div style="text-align: center; "><font face="arial"><b>Arizona State University, Polytechnic campus</b></font></div><div style="text-align: center; "><font face="arial"><b>Administration Building</b></font></div><div style="text-align: center; "><font face="arial"><b>Check-in: </b>10 a.m.</font></div><div style="text-align: center; "><font face="arial"><b>Program: </b>10:30 a.m. – 4 p.m.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">View a <a href="http://asu.edu/map/pdf/asu_map_poly_2013.pdf"><font color="#990000">campus map</font></a> for the location of the Administration Building.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Parking and Directions</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Allow 30 minutes to park and check-in for your campus visit. Park in the visitor section of <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=62773"><font color="#990000">Lot 30</font></a>, located off Innovation Way West. Parking passes will be given at check-in. Please observe and obey all of ASU's posted parking regulations. Visit the <a href="http://cfo.asu.edu/pts-visitor-polytechnic"><font color="#990000">ASU Parking and Transit Services</font></a> website for all parking options and driving directions for the Polytechnic campus. View a <a href="http://www.asu.edu/map/pdf/asu_map_poly_current.pdf"><font color="#990000">parking map</font></a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">For more information, please visit the <a href="http://cfo.asu.edu/pts"><font color="#990000">Parking and Transit Services website</font></a> or call 480-727-2775.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Accommodations</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">For accommodations or information about hotels and attractions in the area, please contact the Mesa Convention and Visitors Bureau at 877-283-6372 or check out <a href="http://www.visitmesa.com/"><font color="#990000">visitmesa.com</font></a>. You can also find more information at <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/travel"><font color="#cc0000">visit.asu.edu/travel</font></a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have questions regarding Scholar Day or need to make changes to your scheduled visit, please call 480-727-1536. We look forward to meeting you!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Liz Hill</font></div><div><font face="arial">Program Coordinator</font></div><div><font face="arial">Campus Visits and Events</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#c0c0c0" size="2">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#c0c0c0" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#c0c0c0" size="2">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>